# Senstoria — environment variables (Sprint 1)
#
# Firebase configuration comes ONLY from these variables. There is no
# committed config file anymore: the AI Studio applet config was deleted.
# The founder copies the values from Firebase Console → Project Settings →
# Your apps → Web app, and pastes them into Vercel → Project Settings →
# Environment Variables. Values must NEVER be committed to the repo or
# pasted into chat.
#
# Required:
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
# Optional (Analytics; omit if unused):
# VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# Gemini (AI Studio runtime only; not used by the Firebase foundation):
# GEMINI_API_KEY is injected by the AI Studio runtime, not by Vercel.
